  "name": "Dungeon Spoils (Heroic) and (Mythic) prefer items for the opener's specialization",
  "contract": "Dungeon Spoils (Heroic) (1202039) and Dungeon Spoils (Mythic) (1027965) give one or two epic dungeon items, never the same item twice. The opener's active specialization names its primary stats in ChrSpecs.dbc fields 8-10, the same stats the specialization card shows: Venomancer Venom (54) lists Intellect and Fortitude (52) Agility and Stamina. Among the rewards the opener can use, the cache prefers an item whose strongest of Strength, Agility, Intellect and Spirit is one of those stats, so after six opens no reward may have a different strongest attribute. About four in five Intellect-fitting rewards carry Intellect, so the Venom Venomancer receives Intellect gear; the Fortitude Venomancer may also receive gear without a primary attribute (attack power, defense or stamina), which suits its Agility and Stamina.",
